                    "title": "Core Web Vitals (phone)",
                    "description": "Largest Contentful Paint (LCP, how long the main content takes to appear), Interaction to Next Paint (INP, how quickly the page responds to taps and clicks) and Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS, how much the page jumps around) for the site on phone. Each value is what 3 in 4 visits met or beat over the last 28 days, colored by its rating.",
